  unitName: Undine
  unitId: 20092
  unitNumber: 113
  description: A beautiful, high-ranked water spirit that lives in lakes. A spirit
    born to defend her own lake, she won't move from the lake she's born in. However,
    if she falls in love, she may leave her lake and pledge to go with her lover.
    She has a fiery and loving personality, but since her appearance suddenly changes
    when betrayed, men fear meeting with her.
  summonDesc: I am Undine.<br>Let's go together.<br>Leave the water magic to me!
  fusionDesc: My power is increasing...<br>This feeling, it's got to be...
